{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"I have to hurry to where </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> and the others are and get rid of </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="8">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Her phone's just sitting on the table, too. Where could they be?"</STYLE><PG>
